/*
 * Implements semantic validation for the containment operators in Ymir:
 *
 *      x in y
 *      x !in y
 *
 * Supported right-hand operand categories:
 *   - class instances(via operator overloading)
 *   - slices
 *   - arrays
 *   - maps
 *   - ranges
 *
 * <hr>
 *
 * @Package: ymirc
 * @Module: ymirc::semantic::validator::value::operator::binary::contains
 * @File: ymirc/semantic/validator/value/operator/binary/contains.yr
 * @Author(s):
 *   - Emile Cadorel <ecadorel@gmail.com>
 *
 * @Created(YYYY-MM-DD): 2026-04-15
 * @Copyright(C) 2021–2026 GNU-Ymir
 * @License
 *   ```text
